+## Measured numbers (spark1)
+
+| Metric | Value |
+|---|---|
+| Load time (cold, `-ngl 0`) | ~13 min |
+| Load time (`-ngl 999` + PLE on disk) | ~1.5 min |
+| Generation | 7.9 t/s (CPU) → **24.7–25.7 t/s** (GPU + PLE on disk) |
